Create a barrier that siphons hate from you at the rate of 0.2 a turn. The barrier will deflect 50% of incoming damage with the force of your will, up to [248, 334, 401, 458, 508 (TL1-5; MP 100)] damage. The barrier charges at a rate of [1/38, 1/25, 1/18, 1/14, 1/12 (TL1-5)] of its maximum charge per turn.

In addition, your ability to channel force with this talent increases all critical damage by [4%, 7%, 10%, 12%, 15% (TL1-5)] (currently: 0%)

The maximum damage deflected increases with your Mindpower.
